{"id":"wb-3-180","name":"南诏铁柱","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"南诏铁柱","text":"南诏铁柱位于云南省大理白族自治州弥渡县弥城镇庙前村铁柱庙内，1965年被列为首批云南省文物保护单位，1988年被列为第三批全国重点文物保护单位。\n柱为铁铸圆柱形，通高3.3米，周长1.025米，重约2069千克。柱身西面有铭文计22字，汉文楷书，直行，阳文：“维建极十三岁次壬辰四月庚子朔十四日癸丑建立”。南诏建极十三年，适当唐咸通十三年，公元872年。铁柱立于铁柱庙正殿内。庙由山门、前院、中院、后院及北院等组成。除铁柱为南诏遗物外，铁柱庙现存主要建筑系清代重建。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8D%97%E8%AF%8F%E9%93%81%E6%9F%B1","revisionId":92656842,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92656842","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/f7d0cdffdb1cb4ef0e2277bc.jpg","title":"Iron_Column_of_the_Nanzhao_State.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Iron_Column_of_the_Nanzhao_State.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/80/Iron_Column_of_the_Nanzhao_State.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Xin","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​南诏铁柱（建极十三年）","width":320,"height":213}}